; Stage 15 W2a: the comparison form of the same rule. A comparison's *result*
; type is i1 regardless, but its operands still unify — and two typed operands
; of different signedness have no unification, so the mixed-sign diagnostic must
; survive W2a. (This is the case the `(> t:ui32 (* 2 cl:ui32))` fix must not
; swallow: there the inner product genuinely IS ui32; here the operands genuinely
; disagree.)
(defvar sv:i32  7)
(defvar uv:ui32 7)

(defn main ():i32
  (when (> sv uv) (return 1))
  (return 0))
